{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_48a50b6f1cca70c7d6b6878699a9ad939c23417a1d9d36cd4415866b6e9e2d67"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The core agent is assembled in a single function, get_agent() in agent/server.py, where the sandbox, model, tools, and triggers can be swapped; custom sandbox providers implement SandboxBackendProtocol from deepagents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_577b614381fab4418b75ea648d9438ea1082f80f4351c694c135902468d1e5d2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"LangSmith is the default sandbox and tracing provider; Modal, Daytona, Runloop, E2B, and local execution are also supported via a pluggable provider interface selected by the SANDBOX_TYPE environment variable."},{"claim_ids":["clm_676c40853ff37e9148beb3dd2417582aaf7277322c59750fe31050ca74c2b4ca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Model defaults are configurable via LLM_MODEL_ID and LLM_REASONING_EFFORT; an Anthropic-only deployment defaults to anthropic:claude-opus-5, other deployments to openai:gpt-5.6-sol, with default reasoning effort medium."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8de56af2cfa5a93a1bf4cb0e3cbfcc3c1da84b2dcf97ace0bd6bcd0b2722226d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Admins can connect remote MCP servers whose enabled tools become available to all coding-agent users; personal MCP connections load only in private threads owned by the triggering user, and plan mode blocks workspace MCP tools."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d9fe1c643132a386b8e356e05b3d4fb227d30657f84769ceefdaae34fb26822e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is under active development and its APIs, setup, and product surfaces may continue to evolve; the local sandbox provider runs commands directly on the host with no isolation and is intended only for development."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f26c6b8dede45e8fd1dbd978bc158faf62561c576a36b146af11efd8467db946"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"For LangSmith sandboxes, GitHub proxy rules give github.com Basic auth for git-over-HTTPS and api.github.com Bearer auth for gh/REST; the proxy token is minted at runtime from GitHub App installation credentials rather than stored as env vars."}],"claim_ids":["clm_48a50b6f1cca70c7d6b6878699a9ad939c23417a1d9d36cd4415866b6e9e2d67","clm_577b614381fab4418b75ea648d9438ea1082f80f4351c694c135902468d1e5d2","clm_676c40853ff37e9148beb3dd2417582aaf7277322c59750fe31050ca74c2b4ca","clm_8de56af2cfa5a93a1bf4cb0e3cbfcc3c1da84b2dcf97ace0bd6bcd0b2722226d","clm_d9fe1c643132a386b8e356e05b3d4fb227d30657f84769ceefdaae34fb26822e","clm_f26c6b8dede45e8fd1dbd978bc158faf62561c576a36b146af11efd8467db946"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:10:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_a42e44b97d324dae98ba2b79642f4a5d","id":"pg_2f156ab3ba445d80b322c61b10ffc252","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/langchain-ai-open-swe-docs-customization-md-1aa5d3b068c0-c61b10ffc252.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_7b3ceefcc93454a881818cfa6136ac1f"],"title":"langchain-ai/open-swe/docs/CUSTOMIZATION.md @ 1aa5d3b068c0","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:10:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a42e44b97d324dae98ba2b79642f4a5d"}
